  triage:title "No PATH_MAX ceiling on tilde-expanded hook paths — S8-RSH-002 re-raised" ;
  triage:description "config/discovery.rs:66 — tilde expansion is present but no check against PATH_MAX after resolution. Oversized expanded paths produce kernel ENAMETOOLONG instead of typed AtmError. Fix: after resolved PathBuf built, check resolved.as_os_str().len() against 4095; return AtmError::config if exceeded." ;
